preview/debug_screens/
preview/upgraded_screens/
preview/verified_screens/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Root Intermediate Image Slices & Slicing Tests
# (Canonical organized assets reside in preview/assets/, Assets/, and ReferencePanels/)
